          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi ikanzu ibanza ku mubiri, uzayiboheshe ubudodo bw'igitare bwiza igire amabara y'ibika, n'igitambaro cyo kuzingirwa mu mutwe ukiboheshe ubudodo bw'ibitare byiza, ubohe n'umushumi, abahanga b'ibyo bawudodeho amabara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abana ba Aroni uzababohere amakanzu abanza ku mubiri, ubabohere n'imishumi n'ingofero, bibe ibyo kubatera icyubahiro n'umurimbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo myambaro yose uzayambike Aroni mwene so n'abana be hamwe na we, ubasīge ubereze umurimo wabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ubereze . . . wabo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu Ruheburayo byanditswe ngo wuzuze amashyi yabo (iby'umurimo wabo.)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ubānyērēze kugira ngo bankorere umurimo w'ubutambyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uzababohere amakabutura y'ibitare bayambare batagaragaza ubwambure, ahere mu rukenyerero agere mu bibero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni n'abana be bazajye bayambara uko bagiye kwinjira mu ihema ry'ibonaniro, no kwegera igicaniro ngo bankorerere Ahera, kugira ngo batagibwaho no gukiranirwa bagapfa, rizamubere itegeko ridakuka we n'urubyaro rukurikiraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
